Learn how to set up and use Fieldd’s new timesheets feature to track worker hours, breaks, and approvals without extra admin work.

In this FielddEDU tutorial, we show how to turn on timesheet permissions, walk through the full worker experience from clocking in to receiving approvals, and explain how to edit, approve, and pay timesheets within your CRM. You’ll also learn how to set and schedule hourly rates, including future raises.

When you’re ready to master your business, we’re here to help: https://fieldd.co

